OL,3,ARussian strike on buses kills at least
OL,4,A30, say officials, as deadly attacks on
OL,5,AUkraine surge
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 30 people have been killed in
OL,8,Fa Russian glide bomb attack on two
OL,9,Fcivilian buses in the frontline city of
OL,10,FKramatorsk, rescue officials say.
OL,12,FAuthorities said three were also killed
OL,13,Fin the village of Bilenke, part of the
OL,14,FKramatorsk community.
OL,16,FAnother 18 people were wounded, said
OL,17,FDonetsk regional head Vadym Filashkin,
OL,18,Faccusing Russia of targeting buses
OL,19,Fcarrying passengers to kill as many
OL,20,Fcivilians as possible.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
